// Title: Add a Workbook_Open VBA macro to automatically sort column D in a macro‑enabled Excel file using Aspose.Cells for .NET (C#)
// AI Prompts: Write VBA code for a Workbook_Open procedure that sorts column D in ascending order and demonstrate how to embed this macro into an Xlsm workbook created with Aspose.Cells in C#. | Update the provided C# Aspose.Cells example to insert a VBA module containing the Workbook_Open sort routine and save the workbook as a macro‑enabled file.
